<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <title>Certificate</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .container {
      margin: 0rem auto;
      padding: 0 55px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    .import-permit {
      height: 2rem;
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -ms-flexbox;
      display: flex;
      -webkit-box-align: center;
      -ms-flex-align: center;
      align-items: center;
      -webkit-box-pack: center;
      -ms-flex-pack: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background-color: red;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
      color: white;
    }

    .application-date {
      margin: .6rem 0rem;
      font-weight: bolder;
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -ms-flexbox;
      display: flex;
      -webkit-box-pack: justify;
      -ms-flex-pack: justify;
      justify-content: space-between;

    }

    .application-info b {
      display: block;

    }

    .application-info p {
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    .application-info {
      width: 50%;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .application-info b {
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .application-subject {
      margin: .5rem 0rem;
    }


    .application-header-text {
      margin: .4rem 0rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .application-header-text b {
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }


    .application-list li {
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }


    .application-list p {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.64;
    }

    .footer-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      align-items: center;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 55px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .footer-container .qr-code {
      width: 40%;
    }

    .footer-container .qr-code img {
      width: 50%;
    }

    .footer-container .signature-container {
      width: 70%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .footer-container .signature {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-container .signature img {
      width: 50%;
    }

    .footer-container .signature hr {
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgb(46, 45, 45);
      width: 60%;
      margin: 5px auto;
    }

    .footer-container .signature .desk-user {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .application-list {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .terms-condition small {
      display: block;
      margin: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    .building-information {
      margin-left: 10px;
    }
  </style>

<body>
  <div class="container container-page-break">
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div class="import-permit">
        <h3>OCCUPANCY</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="application-date">
        <p>Tracking no: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.trackingId)%>
        </p>
        <div>
          <p>Date: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.certificateGenerateDate)%>
          </p>
          <p>
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.lastAmendmentDate)%>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="application-info">
        <p>Building Permit No: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoBuildingPermit)%>
        </p>
        <p>Approval Building Permit Date: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfBuildingPermitDate)%>
        </p>
        <p>Effectiveness Certificate No: <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfFireFightingFloorPlanApprovalCertificate)%>
        </p>
        <p>Effectiveness Certificate Date: <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfFireFightingFloorPlanApprovalCertificateDate)%>
        </p>
        <p>Environmental Certificate No: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfTorForEia)%>
        </p>
        <p>Approval Environmental Certificate Date: <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfTorForEiaDate)%>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="application-subject">
        <b>Attention: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.proposedProjectCompanyName)%></b>
      </div>
    </div>
    <main>
      <p class="application-header-text">
        With reference to the above Permit and Certificate, BEZA-OSS Center of <%=
          formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.economicZone)%> Limited conducted the
          Final
          Inspection on the day of <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.inspectionDate)%> and confirmed the
            building works approved under such Permit and
            Certificate have been
            completed in accordance with the approved plan and specification and the applied Building Code.
            Consequently,
            BEZA-OSS Center issue
            the Certificate here by to <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.proposedProjectCompanyName)%>
              situated at <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.economicZone)%> Limited as
                under:
      </p>
      <div class="application-list">
        <b>1. Terms and conditions for approval:</b>
        <li>i. The certificate shall be valid only for the following building:</li>
        <div class="terms-condition">
          <small> a) Name of Economic Zone : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.economicZone)%></small>
          <small> b) Plot Number : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.plotAddress)%></small>
          <small> c) Building Information:</small>
          <div class="building-information">
            <small>
              1) Land Area(sqm): <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.landArea)%>
            </small>
            <small>
              2) Maximum Ground Clearance (M.G.C) : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.buildingArea)%>
            </small>
            <small>
              3) Total built Area(sqm) : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.totalFloorArea)%>
            </small>
            <small>
              4) Nature of Facility : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.natureOfFacility)%>
            </small>
            <small>
              5) Kind of Construction : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.kindOfConstruction)%>
            </small>
            <small>
              6) Major Structure /storey: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.majorStructure)%>
            </small>
            <small>
              7) Number of Building : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.numberOfBuilding)%>
            </small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <li>ii. In case you make any modification by adding/extending/reducing or in any other form to the approved
          design or plan of the building
          under this Occupation Certificate, you shall be required to apply for a new Building Permit and Fire License
          to BEZA-OSS Center.</li>
        <li>iii. This Occupation Certificate is issued based on the result of Final Inspection for building works on the
          day of <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.requestDateAndTimeForInspection1)%> and
            the issuance of Effectiveness License Approval No. <%=
              formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfFireFightingFloorPlanApprovalCertificate)%>
              issued by the FSCD on the day of <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.approvalNoOfFireFightingFloorPlanApprovalCertificateDate)%>.
        </li>

        <li>iv. You shall submit “Fire safety Plan” with other required documents to BEZA-OSS Center within thirty (30)
          days from the issued date of
          this Occupation Certificate.</li>

        <li>v. You shall obtain “Approval of Commercial Operation” from the BEZA-OSS Center before commencement of
          operation of the factory
          under this Occupation Certificate.</li>

        <li>vi. All future correspondence in terms of this Occupation Certificate shall be addressed to BEZA-OSS Center.
        </li>
      </div>
    </main>
    <div style="
          text-align: center;
          background: #dfbdcd;
          padding: 24px 0 24px 0;
          font-weight: 600;
          color: rgb(171, 34, 34);
          margin-top: 12px;
          opacity: 0.8;
        ">
      <p>THIS IS A COMPUTER GENERATED PERMIT. SO SIGNATURE IS NOT REQUIRED.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

